 "description": "Example: hot DRI transfer conveyor (enclosed) protected by an automatic nitrogen inerting / extinguishing system. Demand = conveyor trip or stoppage under load, leaving hot DRI stationary on the belt (self-heating / re-oxidation, belt ignition). Release is initiated automatically by the stoppage-under-load logic or by fire detection (linear heat detection + CO detectors), or manually from the control room. Top event frequency = uncontrolled conveyor fire per year; gate G-002 gives the PFDavg of the N2 system. All failure data are illustrative – replace with site / vendor data before use.",
